{"version":1,"content":"<p>來到10月尾，終於有點涼風，但偶然都感受秋老虎的威力，天氣又乾燥，出外工作直接面對太陽，都有點辛苦。</p><p>近日有新開雪糕店和乳酪店登場，為大家帶來不同口味的冰品，即時降溫。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;希臘乳酪&lt;br/&gt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T06:21:08.861124+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":104,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T06:00:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T06:18:11.382916+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T06:18:11.382916+00:00","content_hash":"6edb51a5414782ddabb929918bd05885663f9ba0932ff6c4c133105715ee6834","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}